  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- [codex] Generate SDK snippets from OpenAPI examples (#265) 2026-04-11\n- [codex] generate polling helpers from vendor metadata (#269) 2026-04-11\n- [codex] Add first-class idempotency header support (#266) 2026-04-11\n- [codex] support scoped OpenAPI servers (v3) (#272) 2026-04-10\n- [codex] Support remaining official security schemes (#257) 2026-04-10\n- [codex] Support callbacks, webhooks, and links in HTTP artifacts (#251) 2026-04-10\n- feat(csharp): add generated sdk hooks (#268) 2026-04-09\n- feat(csharp): add request and client option support (#267) 2026-04-09\n- feat(csharp): support forward-compatible open enums (#262) 2026-04-09\n- feat(auth): support OpenAPI 3.2 OAuth metadata and device flow (#261) 2026-04-09\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: support oauth auth constructors and snippets 2026-04-14\n- fix(cli): avoid snippet manifest crash for excluded deprecated operations (#275) 2026-04-14\n- [codex] Generate SDK snippets from OpenAPI examples (#265) 2026-04-11\n- [codex] generate polling helpers from vendor metadata (#269) 2026-04-11\n- [codex] Add first-class idempotency header support (#266) 2026-04-11\n- [codex] Stabilize generator CI and snapshot baselines (#270) 2026-04-11\n- fix(generator): restore mTLS client support (#274) 2026-04-11\n- fix(generator): document server selection support (#273) 2026-04-10\n- [codex] support scoped OpenAPI servers (v3) (#272) 2026-04-10\n- [codex] Support remaining official security schemes (#257) 2026-04-10",
